From 93218d553745bb65d9a9d33373d7d2f48fe0eca4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 02:54:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: wrap unwrapped tsmAI() helper in <script> tags across 6
 pages
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Several module pages had a tsmAI() helper function pasted in without its
wrapping <script> tag, causing the raw JS source to render as visible
text on the page instead of executing (the 'compliance.html leak').

Fixed:
- html/finops-suite/compliance.html
- html/legal-pro/legal-tax.html (also had a redundant duplicate
  definition further down the file, already correctly wrapped
  elsewhere — removed the stray duplicate instead of re-wrapping it)
- html/finops-main-strategist1.html
- html/finops-suite/finops-main-strategist/manager-bar-patch.html
- html/finops-suite/finops-main-strategist/index1.html
- html/finops-suite/zero-trust.html

Swept the full repo for other unwrapped tsmAI() occurrences — none
remain. finops-operations.html, legal-account.html, and tax.html
already had the function correctly wrapped, no change needed.

Separately: the 405 on POST /api/chat seen in console is not an app
bug. server.js correctly registers chatRouter.post('/') at /api/chat
with no route-order conflicts. Matches GitHub Codespaces port-forward
auth proxy rejecting POST on a Private-visibility port. Fix: set the
forwarded port to Public in the Codespace Ports tab.
---
 html/finops-main-strategist1.html                              | 1 +
 html/finops-suite/compliance.html                              | 1 +
 html/finops-suite/finops-main-strategist/index1.html           | 1 +
 .../finops-suite/finops-main-strategist/manager-bar-patch.html | 1 +
 html/finops-suite/zero-trust.html                              | 1 +
 html/legal-pro/legal-tax.html                                  | 3 +--
 6 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/html/finops-main-strategist1.html b/html/finops-main-strategist1.html
index 6cbef67b..ab022d17 100644
--- a/html/finops-main-strategist1.html
+++ b/html/finops-main-strategist1.html
@@ -95,6 +95,7 @@ document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
 console.log("TSM_UI: Direct Neural Link Established.");
 </script>
 
+<script>
 async function tsmAI(s,u,m){try{const r=await fetch('/api/financial/query',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({query:s?(s+'\n\n'+u):u,maxTokens:m||1024})});if(!r.ok)throw new Error('Server '+r.status);const d=await r.json();return d.answer||'No response.';}catch(e){return'[AI Error] '+e.message;}}
 </script>
 <script src="/healthcare/js/tsm-bridge.js?v=relay2" defer></script>
